OL,3,A'We want to be heard, not teargassed':
OL,4,AStudents joined by parents and unions
OL,5,Ain mass French protests
OL,6,
OL,7,FStudents, parents and trade unions are
OL,8,Fdemonstrating across France, in protest
OL,9,Fat what they say is under-investment in
OL,10,Fhigh schools
OL,12,FIn the past week, students have
OL,13,Fblockaded hundreds of schools with at
OL,14,Fleast 215 injured, and more than 5,000
OL,15,Fpeople arrested
OL,17,FOn Monday, a student had his hand blown
OL,18,Foff in the city of Lens, northern
OL,19,FFrance, after reportedly picking up a
OL,20,Fpolice stun grenade
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
