OL,3,A'We want to be heard, not teargassed':
OL,4,AStudents joined by parents and unions
OL,5,Ain mass French protests
OL,6,
OL,7,FToday, in nearby Lille, students are
OL,8,Falready gathered outside schools - some
OL,9,Fare holding banners calling for more
OL,10,Finvestment and bins have been set on
OL,11,Ffire, writes our correspondent
OL,13,FThe government says 715 police officers
OL,14,Fhave also been injured since the
OL,15,Fprotests started in Paris in late
OL,16,FSeptember, before spreading across the
OL,17,Fcountry
OL,19,FIn Paris on Tuesday, students held
OL,20,Fbanners saying: "We want to be heard,
OL,21,Fnot teargassed" and: "Our future is not
OL,22,Foptional"
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
